            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Is Lincoln National\u2019s 31.4% 12-Month Rally Justified by Its Current Valuation?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Deciding what to do with Lincoln National stock right now? You are not alone. With the share price recently closing at $39.93, a year-to-date climb of 25.4% and an impressive 31.4% gain over the past 12 months, it is no wonder this name is catching more attention. But if you are feeling torn, especially since the stock slipped 2.0% over the past month even after a solid 3.6% bounce this week, you are probably right to look for deeper clues beneath the headline numbers. Much of the recent...",
